# Tests (Vitest)

- Unit-test `parse` and `format` without VS Code or network.
- Fixtures: anonymized JSON (no tokens). Cover unlimited, missing limit, empty events, month-end working days.
- Mock `UsageService` when testing status bar text/colors.
- Do not add `@vscode/test-electron` unless asked. No tests that print secrets.
